  "description": "Plumatachi chose the path of blind vengeance. She destroyed everything in her path, only bringing chaos and death to the Bad Lands. This wake of devastation could have been avoided if Plumatachi had made different choices. Rather than kill everyone in her path in Blink’s honor, she could have neutralized and punished the former despots and Coal Cauldron by banishing them to the desert far away from all civilization. And thus she would have liberated the Bad Lands from Coal’s yoke and brought back balance to his lands by unifying the different groups and clans with the help of her allies.",
